# dist/ is intentionally COMMITTED (decided 24/08) — `claude plugin install`
# is a plain `git clone`, no build step runs automatically (confirmed on two
# real installs). Rebuild + commit dist/ as part of every release, same as
# any git-distributed CLI tool without a package registry publish step.
